| Viewers         = 3.22<ref name="318Ratings">{{Cite web |last=Porter |first=Rick |date=April 27, 2016 |title=Tuesday final ratings: 'The Voice' adjusts up, 'Containment' adjusts down |url=http://tvbythenumbers.zap2it.com/2016/04/27/tuesday-final-ratings-april-26-2016/ |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160502001225/http://tvbythenumbers.zap2it.com/2016/04/27/tuesday-final-ratings-april-26-2016/ |archive-date=May 2, 2016 |access-date=April 27, 2016 |website=[[TV by the Numbers]]}}</ref>
